	(text "feather_water_level rev 0.2 - non-isolated sensor board, Acconeer XM125 60 GHz radar (A121 + STM32), I2C distance detector, stacked under the nRF54L15 feather.\nSensor Connector: CN1 + host-side parts (VSENS decoupling, R_ID 22k).  Sensor: XM125, 1.8 V LDO from VBAT (EN = VSENS), level translators, flashing test pads.\nThe Sensor sheet joins CN1 by global labels (VSENS, VBAT, GND, SENS_SDA, SENS_SCL, SENS_INT, RADAR_WAKE, RADAR_RST)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 80 0)
